@startuml application_flow
!theme plain
actor "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI Router" as Router
participant "auth/clerk.py" as Auth
participant "Application Service" as Svc
participant "Repository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL 16" as DB
queue "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "apps/worker" as Worker
participant "fleetbase_engine" as FBE
participant "fleetbase-adapter" as FBA
cloud "Fleetbase API" as FB

UI -> Router: HTTPS /v1/*
Router -> Auth: resolve principal
Auth --> Router: principal
Router -> Svc: single service method
Svc -> Repo: CRUD / queries
Repo -> DB: SQL
DB --> Repo: entities
Repo --> Svc: entities
Svc -> Bus: emit_event
Bus -> Worker: handlers / queues
Worker -> FBE: sync_order_from_event
FBE -> FBA: IntegrationBridge
FBA -> FB: HTTP
FB --> FBA: response
Svc --> Router: DTO
Router --> UI: JSON
@enduml
